    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "choosing the dark... that's a strange way to put it. but i get what you mean. it feels like everything is out of my hands. i can't even walk to the kitchen without getting winded. i'm just waiting for something to happen to me, instead of being the one in charge of how it ends.",
